    "details": "<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"bbe8d1d1-33ab-40bd-8337-8fd04845b7c9\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-6-t-mini\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling\">\n<h2 data-start=\"53\" data-end=\"77\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"56\" data-end=\"77\">VIT Code_Apex 3.0</strong></span></h2>\n<p data-start=\"79\" data-end=\"150\"><strong data-start=\"79\" data-end=\"150\">Organised by AISF &ndash; Vishwakarma Institute of Technology (VIT), Pune</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"152\" data-end=\"393\"><strong data-start=\"152\" data-end=\"173\">VIT Code_Apex 3.0</strong> is the third edition of our national-level flagship hackathon, bringing together passionate developers, designers, innovators, and problem-solvers from across India to build impactful solutions to real-world challenges.</p>\n<p data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"624\">The hackathon provides participants with an opportunity to showcase their technical skills, creativity, and problem-solving abilities while competing at a national level and interacting with a community of like-minded innovators.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"654\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"654\">About the Opportunity</strong></span></h2>\n<p data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"719\">VIT Code_Apex 3.0 provides participants with an opportunity to:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"1030\">\n<li data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"772\">Solve real-world and industry-relevant challenges</li>\n<li data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"814\">Build innovative and scalable solutions</li>\n<li data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"865\">Compete with talented students from across India</li>\n<li data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"924\">Showcase technical, creative, and problem-solving skills</li>\n<li data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"977\">Gain exposure to industry-oriented problem solving</li>\n<li data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"1030\">Receive exciting rewards, goodies, and recognition</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1092\">Participants can explore technologies and domains including:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1277\">\n<li data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1138\">Artificial Intelligence &amp; Machine Learning</li>\n<li data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1166\">Web &amp; Backend Development</li>\n<li data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1186\">Blockchain &amp; Web3</li>\n<li data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1204\">Cloud Computing</li>\n<li data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1231\">Data Science &amp; Analytics</li>\n<li data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1247\">Cybersecurity</li>\n<li data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1253\">IoT</li>\n<li data-start=\"1254\" data-end=\"1277\">Emerging Technologies</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1292\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1292\">Tracks</strong></span></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1441\">VIT Code_Apex 3.0 features <strong data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1346\">three exciting tracks</strong>, offering participants different avenues to showcase their innovation and technical expertise.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1458\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1458\">Track 1</strong></span></h3>\n<p data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1474\"><strong data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1474\">Coming Soon</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1560\">Detailed information and the problem statement for Track 1 will be released shortly.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1577\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1577\">Track 2</strong></span></h3>\n<p data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1593\"><strong data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1593\">Coming Soon</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1664\">The details and problem statement for Track 2 will be announced soon.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1666\" data-end=\"1699\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1699\">Track 3 &ndash; Open Innovation</strong></span></h3>\n<p data-start=\"1700\" data-end=\"1712\"><strong data-start=\"1700\" data-end=\"1712\">Open Now</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1789\">Track 3 is the <strong data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1754\">Open Innovation Track</strong>, currently open for registrations.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1791\" data-end=\"2066\">Participants are free to identify a meaningful problem and develop an innovative, technology-driven solution of their choice. Solutions will be evaluated based on factors such as innovation, technical implementation, feasibility, scalability, and potential real-world impact.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2180\">Participants are encouraged to think beyond conventional solutions and build ideas that create meaningful value.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"2182\" data-end=\"2210\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2210\">Competition Structure</strong></span></h2>\n<p data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2272\">VIT Code_Apex 3.0 will be conducted through multiple stages:</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2274\" data-end=\"2307\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"2278\" data-end=\"2307\">Round 1: Online Screening</strong></span></h3>\n<p data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2336\"><strong data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2336\">10th &ndash; 11th October 2026</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"2338\" data-end=\"2547\">Teams will submit their proposed solutions as per the submission guidelines. The submissions will be evaluated based on problem understanding, innovation, technical approach, feasibility, and potential impact.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2549\" data-end=\"2572\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"2553\" data-end=\"2572\">Round 1 Results</strong></span></h3>\n<p data-start=\"2573\" data-end=\"2594\"><strong data-start=\"2573\" data-end=\"2594\">12th October 2026</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"2596\" data-end=\"2667\">Shortlisted teams will be announced and will proceed to the next stage.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2669\" data-end=\"2703\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"2673\" data-end=\"2703\">Round 2: Online Evaluation</strong></span></h3>\n<p data-start=\"2704\" data-end=\"2732\"><strong data-start=\"2704\" data-end=\"2732\">15th &ndash; 18th October 2026</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"2734\" data-end=\"2895\">Shortlisted teams will present their solutions before the evaluation panel and explain their approach, implementation strategy, feasibility, and expected impact.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2897\" data-end=\"2920\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"2901\" data-end=\"2920\">Round 2 Results</strong></span></h3>\n<p data-start=\"2921\" data-end=\"2942\"><strong data-start=\"2921\" data-end=\"2942\">19th October 2026</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"2944\" data-end=\"3019\">The final shortlisted teams will be announced for the offline grand finale.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"3021\" data-end=\"3041\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"3025\" data-end=\"3041\">Grand Finale</strong></span></h3>\n<p data-start=\"3042\" data-end=\"3074\"><strong data-start=\"3042\" data-end=\"3074\">24th October 2026 | VIT Pune</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"3076\" data-end=\"3259\">The final round will be conducted offline at <strong data-start=\"3121\" data-end=\"3166\">Vishwakarma Institute of Technology, Pune</strong>, where shortlisted teams will demonstrate and present their final solutions before the jury.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"3261\" data-end=\"3284\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"3264\" data-end=\"3284\">Rewards &amp; Prizes</strong></span></h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"3286\" data-end=\"3323\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"3290\" data-end=\"3323\">Overall Prize Pool: ₹1,00,000</strong></span></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"3325\" data-end=\"3402\">\n<li data-start=\"3325\" data-end=\"3350\"><strong data-start=\"3327\" data-end=\"3350\">1st Prize &ndash; ₹50,000</strong></li>\n<li data-start=\"3351\" data-end=\"3376\"><strong data-start=\"3353\" data-end=\"3376\">2nd Prize &ndash; ₹30,000</strong></li>\n<li data-start=\"3377\" data-end=\"3402\"><strong data-start=\"3379\" data-end=\"3402\">3rd Prize &ndash; ₹20,000</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"3404\" data-end=\"3486\">In addition to the overall prizes, <strong data-start=\"3439\" data-end=\"3461\">track-wise winners</strong> will also be recognised.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"3488\" data-end=\"3514\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"3492\" data-end=\"3514\">Track-wise Rewards</strong></span></h3>\n<p data-start=\"3516\" data-end=\"3553\">Winners from each track will receive:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"3555\" data-end=\"3601\">\n<li data-start=\"3555\" data-end=\"3578\"><strong data-start=\"3557\" data-end=\"3578\">₹2,000 cash prize</strong></li>\n<li data-start=\"3579\" data-end=\"3601\"><strong data-start=\"3581\" data-end=\"3601\">Exciting goodies</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"3603\" data-end=\"3721\">This gives participants multiple opportunities to win and be recognised for their innovation and technical excellence.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"3723\" data-end=\"3759\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"3727\" data-end=\"3759\">Goodies for All Participants</strong></span></h3>\n<p data-start=\"3761\" data-end=\"3877\">Every participant will receive <strong data-start=\"3792\" data-end=\"3813\">exclusive goodies</strong> as a token of appreciation for being part of VIT Code_Apex 3.0.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"3879\" data-end=\"3911\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"3882\" data-end=\"3911\">Featured Sponsor &ndash; Verzii</strong></span></h2>\n<p data-start=\"3913\" data-end=\"3982\">We are excited to have <strong data-start=\"3936\" data-end=\"3946\">Verzii</strong> as a sponsor for VIT Code_Apex 3.0.</p>\n<p data-start=\"3984\" data-end=\"4104\">Participants are encouraged to <strong data-start=\"4015\" data-end=\"4042\">download the Verzii app</strong> and explore the platform as part of the hackathon experience.</p>\n<p data-start=\"4106\" data-end=\"4217\">Download the Verzii app and stay connected with the opportunities and experiences offered through the platform.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"4219\" data-end=\"4258\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"4222\" data-end=\"4258\">Eligibility &amp; Team Participation</strong></span></h2>\n<ul data-start=\"4260\" data-end=\"4438\">\n<li data-start=\"4260\" data-end=\"4291\">Open to students across India</li>\n<li data-start=\"4292\" data-end=\"4319\">Participation is in teams</li>\n<li data-start=\"4320\" data-end=\"4374\">Participants from different colleges can participate</li>\n<li data-start=\"4375\" data-end=\"4438\">Team size will be as specified in the registration guidelines</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-start=\"4440\" data-end=\"4462\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"4443\" data-end=\"4462\">Important Dates</strong></span></h2>\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableContainer\">\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" style=\"width: 77.7143%; height: 165px;\" data-start=\"4464\" data-end=\"4752\">\n<thead data-start=\"4464\" data-end=\"4480\">\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\" data-start=\"4464\" data-end=\"4480\">\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" style=\"width: 41.0894%; height: 18px;\" data-start=\"4464\" data-end=\"4472\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Event</th>\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" style=\"width: 56.71%; height: 18px;\" data-start=\"4472\" data-end=\"4480\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Date</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"4491\" data-end=\"4752\">\n<tr style=\"height: 42px;\" data-start=\"4491\" data-end=\"4537\">\n<td style=\"width: 41.0894%; height: 42px;\" data-start=\"4491\" data-end=\"4517\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4493\" data-end=\"4516\">Registration Closes</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 56.71%; height: 42px;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4517\" data-end=\"4537\">9th October 2026</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 21px;\" data-start=\"4538\" data-end=\"4580\">\n<td style=\"width: 41.0894%; height: 21px;\" data-start=\"4538\" data-end=\"4552\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4540\" data-end=\"4551\">Round 1</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 56.71%; height: 21px;\" data-start=\"4552\" data-end=\"4580\" data-col-size=\"sm\">10th &ndash; 11th October 2026</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 21px;\" data-start=\"4581\" data-end=\"4624\">\n<td style=\"width: 41.0894%; height: 21px;\" data-start=\"4581\" data-end=\"4603\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4583\" data-end=\"4602\">Round 1 Results</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 56.71%; height: 21px;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4603\" data-end=\"4624\">12th October 2026</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 21px;\" data-start=\"4625\" data-end=\"4667\">\n<td style=\"width: 41.0894%; height: 21px;\" data-start=\"4625\" data-end=\"4639\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4627\" data-end=\"4638\">Round 2</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 56.71%; height: 21px;\" data-start=\"4639\" data-end=\"4667\" data-col-size=\"sm\">15th &ndash; 18th October 2026</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 21px;\" data-start=\"4668\" data-end=\"4711\">\n<td style=\"width: 41.0894%; height: 21px;\" data-start=\"4668\" data-end=\"4690\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4670\" data-end=\"4689\">Round 2 Results</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 56.71%; height: 21px;\" data-start=\"4690\" data-end=\"4711\" data-col-size=\"sm\">19th October 2026</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 21px;\" data-start=\"4712\" data-end=\"4752\">\n<td style=\"width: 41.0894%; height: 21px;\" data-start=\"4712\" data-end=\"4731\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4714\" data-end=\"4730\">Grand Finale</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 56.71%; height: 21px;\" data-start=\"4731\" data-end=\"4752\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24th October 2026</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2 data-start=\"4754\" data-end=\"4783\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"4757\" data-end=\"4783\">Join VIT Code_Apex 3.0</strong></span></h2>\n<p data-start=\"4785\" data-end=\"4882\">Choose your track, bring your ideas to life, and compete with innovators from across the country.</p>\n<p data-start=\"4884\" data-end=\"5105\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">With <strong data-start=\"4889\" data-end=\"5036\">₹1,00,000 in overall cash prizes, track-wise rewards, exciting goodies for every participant, and an opportunity to build solutions that matter</strong>, VIT Code_Apex 3.0 is your platform to <strong data-start=\"5076\" data-end=\"5105\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Compete. Innovate. Build.</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none -mb-px h-px w-full opacity-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableContainer TyagGW_tableContainerWithTableOfContents\">&nbsp;</div>",
